  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Vision humanitarian aid projects 2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">World Visionin humanitaarisen avun hankkeet 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry for Foreign Affairs supports World Vision&apos;s humanitarian aid project in Sudan with 600 000 euros. 

Since the violent eruption of conflict in Sudan, over 10.9 million people have been displaced internally. Escalating violence continues to deepen the humanitarian crisis. This project aims to provide timely life-saving assistance to crisis affected people, including people with disabilities, to reduce mortality and morbidity through providing WASH and protection services in Port Sudan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">Ulkoministeri&#xf6; tukee World Visionin humanitaarisen avun hanketta Sudanissa 600 000 eurolla.

Sudanissa yli 10,9 miljoonaa ihmist&#xe4; on joutunut siirtym&#xe4;&#xe4;n maan sis&#xe4;ll&#xe4; v&#xe4;kivaltaisen konfliktin puhjettua. World Visionin hanke pyrkii tarjoamaan oikea-aikaista ja hengenpelastavaa apua kriisitilanteessa el&#xe4;ville ihmisille, mukaan lukien vammaiset ihmiset, vesi-, sanitaatio-, hygienia- ja suojelutoimintojen kautta Port Sudanissa.</narrative>
  </description>
